# The harness image builds from the repository root so the Dockerfile can copy
# the shared swarmforge package alongside the container-side scripts. Only
# those two directories belong in the context: everything else here is host
# state (ollama blobs, checkouts, editor droppings) that would slow the build
# and invalidate its cache for unrelated reasons.
*
!anvil
!swarmforge
**/__pycache__
